<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ŏphĭūsa</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ŏphĭussa</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀφιοῦσα</span>
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦσσα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An ancient name of Cyprus</i>, whence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ŏphĭūsĭus</span></b> ,
				a, um, <i>Cyprian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
				10</span></i>
			. 229.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The name of several islands</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				11, § 78</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 31, 36, §
			132</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 12, 20,
				§ 61</span></i>; 5, 32, 44, § 151.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A town in Pontus</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12,
				26, § 82</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
